What each file will contain:
CSS file	What belongs inside
variables.css	Colors, fonts, reusable design values
global.css	Body, headings, base styles
utilities.css	Reusable helper classes
components.css	Buttons, badges, cards, modals
layout.css	Sidebar, header, page layout
dashboard.css	Dashboard-specific styles
mold.css	Mold Register and Mold Details
forms.css	Form fields, validation, form buttons
tables.css	Data tables, filters, pagination

